0.030" end="00:31.010">words</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.510" end="00:36.840"><span begin="00:32.510" end="00:34.240">Melodies </span><span begin="00:34.240" end="00:34.460">and </span><span begin="00:34.460" end="00:36.840">memories</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.050" end="00:41.340"><span begin="00:37.050" end="00:38.510">Stories </span><span begin="00:38.510" end="00:39.110">that </span><span begin="00:39.110" end="00:39.850">sound </span><span begin="00:39.850" end="00:41.340">absurd</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.070" end="00:49.880"><span begin="00:42.070" end="00:42.420">I </span><span begin="00:42.420" end="00:42.610">will </span><span begin="00:42.610" end="00:43.510">tell </span><span begin="00:43.510" end="00:44.630">no </span><span begin="00:44.630" end="00:49.880">lies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.880" end="00:59.410"><span begin="00:50.880" end="00:51.340">As </span><span begin="00:51.340" end="00:51.820">long </span><span begin="00:51.820" end="00:52.030">as </span><span begin="00:52.030" end="00:52.760">you </span><span begin="00:52.760" end="00:56.270">look </span><span begin="00:56.270" end="00:56.870">me </span><span begin="00:56.870" end="00:56.950">in </span><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.360">the </span><span begin="00:57.360" end="00:59.410">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.730" end="01:02.490"><span begin="00:59.730" end="01:00.350">I'll </span><span begin="01:00.350" end="01:00.910">go </span><span begin="01:00.910" end="01:01.920">wherever </span><span begin="01:01.920" end="01:02.440">you </span><span begin="01:02.440" end="01:02.490">are</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.890" end="01:09.230"><span begin="01:05.890" end="01:06.230">I'll </span><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:07.000">follow </span><span begin="01:07.000" end="01:09.230">behind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.030" end="01:12.430"><span begin="01:10.030" end="01:10.260">Heard </span><span begin="01:10.260" end="01:10.790">about </span><span begin="01:10.790" end="01:11.020">all </span><span begin="01:11.020" end="01:11.100">the </span><span begin="01:11.100" end="01:11.500">things </span><span begin="01:11.500" end="01:11.760">you </span><span begin="01:11.760" end="01:12.430">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.430" end="01:14.710"><span begin="01:12.430" end="01:12.610">And </span><span begin="01:12.610" end="01:12.730">all </span><span begin="01:12.730" end="01:12.880">the </span><span begin="01:12.880" end="01:13.210">walls </span><span begin="01:13.210" end="01:13.490">that </span><span begin="01:13.490" end="01:13.690">you've </span><span begin="01:13.690" end="01:14.060">been </span><span begin="01:14.060" end="01:14.710">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.000" end="01:17.340"><span begin="01:15.000" end="01:15.290">Heard </span><span begin="01:15.290" end="01:15.780">about </span><span begin="01:15.780" end="01:16.000">all </span><span begin="01:16.000" end="01:16.120">the </span><span begin="01:16.120" end="01:16.470">love </span><span begin="01:16.470" end="01:16.760">you </span><span begin="01:16.760" end="01:17.340">lost</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.340" end="01:19.170"><span begin="01:17.340" end="01:17.430">It </span><span begin="01:17.430" end="01:17.620">was </span><span begin="01:17.620" end="01:18.020">over </span><span begin="01:18.020" end="01:18.590">before </span><span begin="01:18.590" end="01:18.670">it </span><span begin="01:18.670" end="01:19.170">began</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.070" end="01:22.380"><span begin="01:20.070" end="01:20.300">Heard </span><span begin="01:20.300" end="01:20.820">about </span><span begin="01:20.820" end="01:21.000">all </span><span begin="01:21.000" end="01:21.080">the </span><span begin="01:21.080" end="01:21.490">miles </span><span begin="01:21.490" end="01:21.800">you've </span><span begin="01:21.800" end="01:22.380">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.470" end="01:24.820"><span begin="01:22.470" end="01:22.900">Just </span><span begin="01:22.900" end="01:23.050">to </span><span begin="01:23.050" end="01:23.780">start </span><span begin="01:23.780" end="01:24.820">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.980" end="01:27.350"><span begin="01:24.980" end="01:25.260">Heard </span><span begin="01:25.260" end="01:25.780">about </span><span begin="01:25.780" end="01:26.020">all </span><span begin="01:26.020" end="01:26.080">the </span><span begin="01:26.080" end="01:26.200">things </span><span begin="01:26.200" end="01:26.470">you've </span><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:26.740">been </span><span begin="01:26.740" end="01:27.350">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.350" end="01:31.660"><span begin="01:27.350" end="01:27.530">It </span><span begin="01:27.530" end="01:27.910">sounds </span><span begin="01:27.910" end="01:28.110">like </span><span begin="01:28.110" end="01:28.200">you </span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:28.750">need </span><span begin="01:28.750" end="01:28.870">a </span><span begin="01:28.870" end="01:29.480">friend </span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:30.190">a </span><span begin="01:30.190" end="01:31.660">friend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.030" end="01:38.130"><span begin="01:35.030" end="01:36.030">Please </span><span begin="01:36.030" end="01:36.910">don't </span><span begin="01:36.910" end="01:38.130">wait</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.540" end="01:43.670"><span begin="01:38.540" end="01:38.770">I'm </span><span begin="01:38.770" end="01:39.130">not </span><span begin="01:39.130" end="01:39.690">coming </span><span begin="01:39.690" end="01:41.860">home </span><span begin="01:41.860" end="01:43.670">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.700" end="01:51.360"><span begin="01:44.700" end="01:45.380">I </span><span begin="01:45.380" end="01:46.190">wanna </span><span begin="01:46.190" end="01:46.720">love </span><span begin="01:46.720" end=